  m_Name: JournalEntry1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalEntry
  entryTitle: Arrival Log - Day 1
  diskItemId: data_disk_01
  entryText: 'Touchdown successful. Atmosphere is breathable with assist, gravity
    0.9G. First impressions: this place is dead quiet. No wind, no insects, nothing.
    Scanners are picking up faint bioluminescent flora near the ridge - something
    we didn''t see in any of the satellite imagery. Command wants samples before
    we set up the base perimeter. Spirits are high. We didn''t come all this way
    for nothing.


    - K. Reyes, Mission Log 001


    P.S. password is light'
